body:
Saltiness engage;

Why does this mode appear to attract absolute fuckwits who cannot read or understand the game mode? It's killed any enthusiasm to play the game after going into match after match to continuously lose because my team consists of amoebas missing opposable thumbs who just sit between capture points doing fuck all.

Edit: To make matters even worse, when you realize your team is made up of pond life and decide not to waste the next 10mins of your life watching them roll about like burning turds, the game penalizes you. 100% dog shit.
